      <title>Introduction to Viṣṇu</title>
      <link>https://vishvAsa.github.io/devaH/AryaH/hindukaH/viShNuH/meta/articles/2026-06-15_Introduction_to_viShNu/</link>
      <pubDate>Mon, 15 Jun 2026 00:00:00 +0000</pubDate>
      <guid>https://vishvAsa.github.io/devaH/AryaH/hindukaH/viShNuH/meta/articles/2026-06-15_Introduction_to_viShNu/</guid>
      <description>&lt;p&gt;Source: &lt;a href=&#34;https://mravinderreddy.substack.com/p/introduction-to-visnu&#34;&gt;here&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;&#xA;&lt;p&gt;Introduction to Viṣṇu&lt;/p&gt;&#xA;&lt;h1 id=&#34;introduction-to-viṣṇu&#34;&gt;Introduction to Viṣṇu&lt;/h1&gt;&#xA;&lt;h3 id=&#34;vaiṣṇavism-from-the-late-bronze-age-to-the-modern-era-a-history-of-viṣṇu-and-of-why-we-keep-getting-its-age-wrong&#34;&gt;Vaiṣṇavism from the Late Bronze Age to the modern era: a history of Viṣṇu, and of why we keep getting its age wrong.&lt;/h3&gt;&#xA;&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href=&#34;https://substack.com/@mravinderreddy&#34;&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&#xA;&lt;figure class=&#34;&#34;&gt;&#xA;&#xA;    &lt;a href=&#34;https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!2Tvm!,w_36,h_36,c_fill,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F77da9531-28fb-41f8-b757-599e5b73f4c6_1202x1204.png&#34; target=&#34;_blank&#34; rel=&#34;noopener&#34;&gt;&#xA;        &lt;img src=&#34;https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!2Tvm!,w_36,h_36,c_fill,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F77da9531-28fb-41f8-b757-599e5b73f4c6_1202x1204.png&#34; alt=&#34;Ravinder Reddy&amp;rsquo;s avatar&#34; title=&#34;&#34;&gt;&#xA;    &lt;/a&gt;&#xA;&#xA;    &#xA;&#xA;&lt;/figure&gt;&#xA;&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href=&#34;https://substack.com/@mravinderreddy&#34;&gt;Ravinder Reddy&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&#xA;&lt;p&gt;Jun 15, 2026&lt;/p&gt;&#xA;&lt;figure class=&#34;&#34;&gt;&#xA;&#xA;    &lt;a href=&#34;#ZgotmplZ&#34; target=&#34;_blank&#34; rel=&#34;noopener&#34;&gt;&#xA;        &lt;img src=&#34;#ZgotmplZ&#34; alt=&#34;&#34; title=&#34;&#34;&gt;&#xA;    &lt;/a&gt;&#xA;&#xA;    &#xA;&#xA;&lt;/figure&gt;&#xA;&lt;p&gt;24&lt;/p&gt;&#xA;&lt;figure class=&#34;&#34;&gt;&#xA;&#xA;    &lt;a href=&#34;#ZgotmplZ&#34; target=&#34;_blank&#34; rel=&#34;noopener&#34;&gt;&#xA;        &lt;img src=&#34;#ZgotmplZ&#34; alt=&#34;&#34; title=&#34;&#34;&gt;&#xA;    &lt;/a&gt;&#xA;&#xA;    &#xA;&#xA;&lt;/figure&gt;&#xA;&lt;figure class=&#34;&#34;&gt;&#xA;&#xA;    &lt;a href=&#34;#ZgotmplZ&#34; target=&#34;_blank&#34; rel=&#34;noopener&#34;&gt;&#xA;        &lt;img src=&#34;#ZgotmplZ&#34; alt=&#34;&#34; title=&#34;&#34;&gt;&#xA;    &lt;/a&gt;&#xA;&#xA;    &#xA;&#xA;&lt;/figure&gt;&#xA;&lt;p&gt;6&lt;/p&gt;&#xA;&lt;p&gt;Share&lt;/p&gt;&#xA;&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href=&#34;https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!7_TB!,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F84ef2c9b-094e-43db-a447-b8b73ee49f68_958x1122.png&#34;&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&#xA;&lt;figure class=&#34;&#34;&gt;&#xA;&#xA;    &lt;a href=&#34;https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!7_TB!,w_1456,c_limit,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F84ef2c9b-094e-43db-a447-b8b73ee49f68_958x1122.png&#34; target=&#34;_blank&#34; rel=&#34;noopener&#34;&gt;&#xA;        &lt;img src=&#34;https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!7_TB!,w_1456,c_limit,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F84ef2c9b-094e-43db-a447-b8b73ee49f68_958x1122.png&#34; alt=&#34;&#34; title=&#34;&#34;&gt;&#xA;    &lt;/a&gt;&#xA;&#xA;    &#xA;&#xA;&lt;/figure&gt;&#xA;&lt;figure class=&#34;&#34;&gt;&#xA;&#xA;    &lt;a href=&#34;#ZgotmplZ&#34; target=&#34;_blank&#34; rel=&#34;noopener&#34;&gt;&#xA;        &lt;img src=&#34;#ZgotmplZ&#34; alt=&#34;&#34; title=&#34;&#34;&gt;&#xA;    &lt;/a&gt;&#xA;&#xA;    &#xA;&#xA;&lt;/figure&gt;&#xA;&lt;figure class=&#34;&#34;&gt;&#xA;&#xA;    &lt;a href=&#34;#ZgotmplZ&#34; target=&#34;_blank&#34; rel=&#34;noopener&#34;&gt;&#xA;        &lt;img src=&#34;#ZgotmplZ&#34; alt=&#34;&#34; title=&#34;&#34;&gt;&#xA;    &lt;/a&gt;&#xA;&#xA;    &#xA;&#xA;&lt;/figure&gt;&#xA;&lt;p&gt;Lord Vishnu with Consort Lakshmi in a Bilaspur painting of 1810 AD at SJ Museum, Hyderabad, India&lt;/p&gt;&#xA;&lt;p&gt;Open the Ṛgveda, the oldest large body of poetry in any Indo-European language, and you meet a god who measured out the universe in three strides:&lt;/p&gt;</description>
