    <item>
      <title>ShroNA abhijit kRShNa</title>
      <link>https://vishvAsa.github.io/devaH/AryaH/hindukaH/viShNuH/meta/articles/shroNA-abhijit-kRShNa/</link>
      <pubDate>Mon, 01 Jan 0001 00:00:00 +0000</pubDate>
      <guid>https://vishvAsa.github.io/devaH/AryaH/hindukaH/viShNuH/meta/articles/shroNA-abhijit-kRShNa/</guid>
      <description>&lt;p&gt;Source: &lt;a href=&#34;https://x.com/Saatvata/status/2097141786078740722&#34;&gt;TW&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&#xA;&lt;p&gt;Abhijit is the only &amp;ldquo;masculine nakṣatra.&amp;rdquo;&lt;/p&gt;&#xA;&lt;p&gt;The other 27 nakṣatras are personified as daughters of Dakṣa and wives of the moon whereas Abhijit being an intercalary/supplemental nakṣatra is personified as their brother.&lt;/p&gt;&#xA;&lt;p&gt;The moon does not &amp;ldquo;spend the night&amp;rdquo; with Abhijit in the traditional cyclical sense since he is the &amp;ldquo;brother-in-law&amp;rdquo; of the moon.&lt;/p&gt;&#xA;&lt;p&gt;Abhijit lies between Uttarāṣāḍha and Śravaṇa/Śroṇā, as mentioned in the Vedas.&lt;/p&gt;&#xA;&lt;p&gt;&amp;ldquo;Abhijín nā́ma nákṣatram upáriṣṭād aṣāḍhā́nām adhástāc Chroṇā́yāḥ (vl. avástāc Chroṇā́yai)&amp;rdquo;&lt;/p&gt;</description>
    </item>
    <item>
      <title>अष्ट-प्रकरण-शैव-कल्पनम्</title>
      <link>https://vishvAsa.github.io/devaH/AryaH/hindukaH/viShNuH/meta/articles/aShTa-prakaraNa-shaiva-kalpanam/</link>
